---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// New follower set-up: snapshot position plus log; failure when the log was trimmed. Entry numbers are illustrative.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Two cases for a new follower. Top: it loads a snapshot that ends at entry 41, then asks the leader for entry 42 onward and catches up. Bottom: the leader already deleted entries 39 to 43, so the follower cannot ask for 42 and must be rebuilt from a full copy.">
    <DiagramIcon name="sync" x={34} y={95} size={30} />
    <text x="62" y="100" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Set up in time</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dựng kịp lúc</tspan></text>
    <text x="316" y="56" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>in the snapshot</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nằm trong snapshot</tspan></text>
    <text x="636" y="56" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>streamed from the leader's log</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhận qua log của leader</tspan></text>
    <rect x="200" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="236" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#39</text>
    <rect x="280" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="316" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#40</text>
    <rect x="360" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="396" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#41</text>
    <rect x="440" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="476" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#42</text>
    <rect x="520" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="556" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#43</text>
    <rect x="600" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="636" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#44</text>
    <rect x="680" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="716" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#45</text>
    <rect x="760" y="73" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="796" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#46</text>
    <text x="450" y="140" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>The follower loads the snapshot (ends at #41), then asks for #42 and everything after it.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower nạp snapshot (kết thúc ở #41), rồi xin #42 và mọi thứ sau nó.</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={34} y={215} size={30} />
    <text x="62" y="220" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Away too long</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vắng quá lâu</tspan></text>
    <text x="396" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>already deleted by the leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>leader đã xoá</tspan></text>
    <text x="716" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>still on the leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>còn ở leader</tspan></text>
    <rect x="200" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad empty" />
    <text x="236" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#39</text>
    <rect x="280" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad empty" />
    <text x="316" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#40</text>
    <rect x="360" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad empty" />
    <text x="396" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#41</text>
    <rect x="440" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad empty" />
    <text x="476" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#42</text>
    <rect x="520" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box bad empty" />
    <text x="556" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#43</text>
    <rect x="600" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="636" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#44</text>
    <rect x="680" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="716" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#45</text>
    <rect x="760" y="193" width="72" height="44" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="796" y="220" text-anchor="middle" class="t-mono">#46</text>
    <text x="450" y="272" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>The snapshot ends at #41, so the follower needs #42 next, but #42 is gone.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Snapshot kết thúc ở #41, nên follower cần #42 kế tiếp, nhưng #42 đã mất.</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>It cannot catch up and must be rebuilt from a full copy.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nó không đuổi kịp được và phải dựng lại từ một bản sao đầy đủ.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The snapshot ends at a known position, and the follower asks for everything after it. If the leader has already thrown that part of the log away, the follower must start over. Entry numbers are illustrative; PostgreSQL calls the position an LSN, MySQL uses binlog coordinates or GTIDs.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Snapshot kết thúc ở một vị trí đã biết, và follower xin mọi thứ sau đó. Nếu leader đã vứt phần log ấy, follower phải làm lại từ đầu. Số entry chỉ để minh hoạ; PostgreSQL gọi vị trí này là LSN, MySQL dùng toạ độ binlog hoặc GTID.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
